			"local_notes": "Lore: Court protocol inside the Priesthood: correct forms of address for a Magos or Archmagos, ritual precedence between Forge Worlds and Explorator fleets, and which questions are simply never asked of a superior adept. Not attested under this exact name in the fiction, but the Mechanicus is consistently shown (across Black Library and codex background) to run on a court culture at least as rigid as the Ecclesiarchy's own.\n\nDesign: New specialization of Basic Set Savoir-Faire (B218), by the same reasoning and construction this project already used for Savoir-Faire (Ecclesiarchy) in Imperium/Skills/Imperial Skills.skl: same skill, same difficulty, applied to a hierarchy the game needs and the catalogue doesn't name.",
